        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI SIG413-630, Contemporary Offset Stainless Steel Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Contoured Grip Handle is 9-9/16 inches long with 8-3/8 inch mounting centers. It is made out solid stainless steel with a satin finish. The Offset Stainless Steel Door Pull can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-SIG413-specifications.gif?v=1704442263\" width=\"196\" height=\"284\" border=\"0\" alt=\"AHI SIG413 Stainless Offset Door Pull\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the AHI SIG413 Offset Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li> \r\n<li>Total Length: 9-9/16\" (243 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-3/8\" (213 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3\" (76 mm)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is Discontinued</b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
