                "title": "Offset Stainless Steel Door Pull",
                "description": "This Contoured Grip Handle is 9-9/16 inches long with 8-3/8 inch mounting centers. It is made out solid stainless steel with a satin finish. The Offset Stainless Steel Door Pull can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted. \r\n",
